'''North''' was a [[:Category:Denmark|Danish]] esports organization and the esports affiliate of [[wikipedia:F.C._Copenhagen|F.C. Copenhagen]] and [[wikipedia:Nordisk_Film|Nordisk Film]], founded in January 2017. It ceased operations in February 2021, citing the COVID-19 pandemic and lack of investors as reasons for the decision. <ref name="North 2021 shutdown">{{cite web|url=https://www.fck.dk/nyhed/pse-og-nordisk-film-afvikler-north|title=PS&E og Nordisk Film afvikler North|language={{Flag|dk}} Danish|trans_title=PS&E and Nordisk Film wind up North|date=2021-02-05|publisher=[[wikipedia:F.C._Copenhagen|F.C. Copenhagen]]}}</ref>

